(text "MAF connector (GX12-7): separate analog and frequency pins; the harness uses the one that matches the MAF." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 31e0b80e-aeb7-4eba-8572-4090e8335053))
(text "Bosch 0280218335 is analog 0-5 V, harness ID 1.0 k. JP2 adds a 5 V pull-up for open-collector frequency MAFs." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 784d1c9c-479a-4e06-a15d-3e9d52e39acd))
